    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109267" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποσυγ-χέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>confuse,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν Πίσαν καὶ τὴν Ἦλιν</span>
